# 原紙箱 and 原紙集め (design 11.2.2, 11.2.3), for tools/ui_run.py. The system's
# 原紙箱 (its window at 893,35, its work area from 903,64, the links from 8,8 of
# it, 27 apart) is an ordinary box of links to the templates: its own template
# is in it, and carried into the BTRON window it makes a new 原紙箱 holding
# links to the templates the system's holds, laid out as the system's are. An
# application deleted takes its template's link out of the system's 原紙箱, and
# registered again puts it back. 原紙集め (its work area from 670,69, the links
# laid out in rows as wide as it, 27 apart) lists every template. The link of 空書庫 taken out
# of the 原紙箱 leaves the template, and carried from 原紙集め into the 原紙箱 a
# new object made from it is put there. A text put into the 原紙箱 is a template
# of the person's (ユーザ原紙): carried out, a copy is made and the text stays as
# it was.
waitwin 原紙箱
# the 原紙箱 in front of the text TADjsについて, which lies over it
click 1000 48
wait 300
shot bb_front
# its own template carried into the BTRON window: a new 原紙箱
linkdrag 原紙箱 原紙箱 250 60
wait 1000
key 28
expect desktop: 原紙箱 made from the template 原紙箱
expect dtprog: new 原紙箱 given the system's 16 templates (0)
wait 800
# opened: a 原紙箱 of its own holding the templates the system's holds, closed again (Ctrl+E).
# It keeps the system's 原紙箱's place (its template's), where that window stands: it opens a
# step down and across, its window at 921,63 (the links from 939,99, 27 apart)
logmark
dclick 250 60
expectsince basebox: opened 原紙箱 shapes 16 links 16
wait 1500
shot bb_new
# the 原紙箱's ways hold in it as in the system's: 画用紙 (its second link, at 939,126)
# dragged down stays where it was, and 基本文章編集 (the first, at 939,99) carried
# into the BTRON window makes a new object from the template
drag 988 135 1008 328
wait 800
# 〈整頓〉 grey in its menu (opened away from the links), with 画用紙 taken
logmark
click 1028 588 1
expectsince basebox: arrange menu grey
wait 400
key 29
wait 700
key 29
wait 500
drag 988 108 250 150
wait 1000
key 28
expect desktop: 基本文章編集 made from the template 基本文章編集
wait 800
# closed (Ctrl+E) and opened again: as it was first shown
click 1018 76
wait 300
key 08 01
wait 800
logmark
dclick 250 60
expectsince basebox: opened 原紙箱 shapes 16 links 16
wait 1500
shot bb_new2
shotsame bb_new bb_new2 921 63 1121 663
key 08 01
wait 800
# MPEG Player deleted: its template's link out of the system's 原紙箱; registered again: back
progrm 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok 0
expect template 0 of mpeg-player taken out of the 原紙箱 (0)
proginst 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok 0
expect template 0 of mpeg-player linked from the 原紙箱 (0)
wait 800
shot bb_reinst
# 空書庫 (the 12th link, at 911,369) chosen and taken out of the 原紙箱
click 1000 48
wait 300
click 940 378
wait 300
key 4C
wait 800
shot bb_deleted
# 原紙集め from its program object: every template of the applications
open 01a0d8c4-5b92-7c53-8d64-9fab0c1d5b92
waitwin 原紙集め
expect basecol: up
expect basecol: 16 templates
wait 1000
shot bb_collect
# 空書庫 (the 10th row, at 678,319, 手帳用紙 beside it) carried from 原紙集め into the 原紙箱,
# under its links
drag 700 328 990 600
wait 1000
key 28
expect desktop: template carried, made from it: 0
expect basecol: carried 空書庫 (0)
wait 800
shot bb_back
# the text 実身/仮身 put into the 原紙箱 (its link carried there out of the text
# TADjsについて, at 315,323), and carried out into that text again: a copy is made, the
# text stays as it was (the BTRON window is sealed: nothing is carried out of it or into it)
sum 019a6c9b-e67e-7a35-a461-0d199550e4cf
keep text
# the text's window moved 140 left and 100 down, off the 原紙箱's links
drag 500 148 360 248
wait 800
drag 175 423 1000 560
wait 800
shot bb_user
# the link put into the 原紙箱 (a process, which has not saved it: linkdrag reads the stored
# record) is at 926,551 to 1076,570 of the screen: carried from its middle
drag 1001 560 400 600
wait 1000
key 28
expect desktop: 実身/仮身 made from the template 実身/仮身
wait 800
sum 019a6c9b-e67e-7a35-a461-0d199550e4cf
same text
shot bb_user_out
absent !OACV!
